<title>TAIWAN: Far Eastern 1st quarter net profit soars.</title>
<headline>Far Eastern 1st quarter net profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				 6,874 vs   7,198</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1,183 vs     108</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 1,183 vs     108</p>
<p>NOTE - Far Eastern Extile Ltd is Taiwan's largest textile maker. The company attributed its profit surge to rebounding textile prices and a T$600 million stock sell-off.</p>
<p>The firm has set a 1997 net profit target of T$2.605 billion on sales of T$30.508 billion.</p>
</text>
